--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `autoload` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
auto<|>load 'Shop' from 'src';
--FILE src/User.nvs--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;
class User { }
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
